# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Good job!\n"
"Excellent!\n"
"I wasn't sure you'd make it back alive.\n"
"Kergmond had more potential than I realized, but you're certainly more than a match for an army of Kergmonds.\n"
"You've proven yourselves worthy of the rank of champion. You must not be afraid to take up arms to defend what is right.\n"
"May your enemies fear your approach and your allies rally behind your courage. And now, I promote you to the rank of champion!"
msgstr ""
"干得好，实在好极了！我原以为你不能活着出来。科格蒙德比我想象的还利害，然而你比他更出色。你已经证明了你具有勇士的能力。你会毫无惧色的挺身捍卫正义。现在你的敌人害怕与你交战，而你的盟友将在你的勇气鼓舞之下恢复力量和信心。现在我把你升级为勇士。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Good job!\n"
"With the information you've brought back, we now have the intelligence we need to stage an attack on the devils, and with that post out of the way, we can hit them when they won't expect it. I give you my full support in the council– hopefully the council will actually DO something for once."
msgstr ""
"干得好。根据你带回来的情报，我们掌握了敌人的战略部署。既然这个前哨已被清除，我们就能攻它个出其不意。我会在议会里全力支持你的，希望议会还能干点正事。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Good tidings. I am {name}, {imp} {cls}. I'd love to see the world and taste the adventure, but it'd be foolish to go alone. Perhaps I could come with you?"
msgstr "幸会。我是{name}，{imp}{cls}。我很想去看看世界、尝尝冒险的滋味，可一个人上路太傻了。能带上我吗？"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Good work!\n"
"I'm glad you made it in time.\n"
"I don't like to think about what Baa would have done with that crystal.\n"
"You have done all of Enroth a great service."
msgstr "干得好。很高兴你能及时完成任务。我可不愿看到羊鸣教用水晶来为非作歹，你为整个恩洛斯做了件大好事。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Good work!\n"
"Some day, your sabotage of that watchtower will save hundreds of lives.\n"
"For your services, I hereby promote the Rogues among you to the status of Spy, and the Honorary Rogues to Honorary Spies! Oh, and here's some gold as payment."
msgstr ""
"干得太棒了，你们这次行动的成功将在未来的战斗中挽救数百人的生命。鉴于你们的功绩，我将你们之中的神偷提拔为密探，荣誉神偷提拔为荣誉密探! 这里还有一笔奖金，你们拿去吧。"

