msgid "Hive"
msgstr "蜂巢"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Hmm.\n"
"Removing the weight from the upper gatehouse was a start, but where is it now?!?\n"
"The plan won't work unless you put the weight in the lower gatehouse!\n"
"Go back to Watchtower 6 and put the weight in the right box!"
msgstr ""
"嗯，光把顶门石从塔顶移开可不行。你们把它放什么地方去了？如果石头没放到塔楼底层，我们的计划就前功尽弃了！快回6 号哨塔，把石头放到应该放的地方去。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "Hmmm. Nothing a little glue and polish won't fix, I warrant. "
msgstr "嗯，我保证，一点胶水加点打磨就好了。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Hmmm. Nothing a little glue and polish won't fix, I warrant. My policy is to ask for {a#} gold, but I can go as low as {b#}."
msgstr "嗯……抹点胶水再打磨一下就好，包在我身上。按规矩要收 {a#} 金币，不过给你可以降到 {b#}。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Hmph. Looks like junk to me. <yawn> I suppose I could give you oh, say, {n#} gold pieces for it."
msgstr "哼，在我看来就是件破烂。<哈欠> 这样吧，我出 {n#} 个金币收了它。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "Holding it reserves {what}"
msgstr "维持它将保留{what}"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "House of Hawthorne "
msgstr "霍桑家族宅邸"

