msgstr "击倒该角色所需的伤害，对 {level} 级怪物："

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"How much damage it takes to fell this character, against monsters of level {n#}: maximum Hit Points (with Mana Shield's mana and Grandmaster Dodging) over the share of an average hit that gets through armour and resistances."
msgstr "对 {n#} 级怪物而言，击倒该角色所需的伤害：最大生命值（含法力护盾的法力和宗师闪避）除以一次平均攻击穿透护甲和抗性的比例。"

