"\n"
"Vitality: {r}"
msgstr ""
"对 {n#} 级怪物而言，击倒该角色所需的伤害：最大生命值（含法力护盾的法力和宗师闪避）除以一次平均攻击穿透护甲和抗性的比例。\n"
"\n"
"生存力：{r}"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"I am Melian, Guardian of Enroth.\n"
"Thank you for replacing my memory modules.\n"
"Archibald took them from here when I refused to give him any help in his battle for succession.\n"
"Your timing is impeccable.\n"
"The Kreegan have invaded our world, and you must try and stop them.\n"
"Unfortunately, Archibald's attempts at extracting information from me have damaged me enough that I cannot help you directly now.\n"
"Instead, I can only give you advice.While most of the Kreegan can be slain with ordinary weapons and spells, the elite guards and upper echelon breeders have tougher skin and natural defenses that protect them from anything but very powerful weapons.\n"
"In the planetary control center beneath me are the weapons and armor you will need to survive battle with the enemy.\n"
"My orders, however, will only permit passage to someone with a Control Cube.\n"
"My instruments tell me that the only Control Cube left in Enroth can be found somewhere underground in Dragonsand."
msgstr ""
"我是梅里安，恩洛斯的守护神。谢谢你将我的记忆模板放回原处。因为我拒绝在继承王位战争中帮助阿基巴德，他就从我这里取走了记忆模板。你的到来真是好极了。现在克里根人正在入侵我们的世界，你必须尽力去阻止他们。不幸的是，我不能直接帮助你了。阿基巴德从我这里榨取信息，使我元气大伤。我唯一能帮你就是给你一条建议。\n"
" 尽管普通的武器和魔法可以杀死大多数克里根人，但他们的精锐卫兵和高等部队皮肤坚硬，有着过人的自然防御力，只有非常锋利的武器才能杀伤他们。在我下面的行星控制中心里有你战斗需要的盔甲和武器。然而只有拥有控制方块的人才可以进入。我的仪器告诉我恩洛斯唯一的控制方块就在飞龙沙漠的地下。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"I am a collector of rare and exotic creatures, and I make a living by selling some of these creatures as pets.\n"
"Currently, cobras are in great demand, and I don't have many cobras left to sell.\n"
"Therefore, I'm willing to pay handsomely for any cobra eggs you might have.\n"
"Remember, if you find any cobra eggs, I'll give you the best prices."
msgstr ""
"我是个珍稀动物的收藏者。靠贩卖此类动物给人当宠物谋生。现在眼镜蛇很抢手，但我的存货不多。你如果手头上有眼镜蛇蛋我愿出高价。记住，如果你找到眼镜蛇蛋，我会出最令你满意的价钱。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"I am the magus responsible for\n"
"the promotion of sorcerers.\n"
"Though none of you are sorcerers, I'm a fair man.\n"
"If you are able to locate the Fountain of Magic, I'll grant you honorary wizard status.\n"
"You won't receive any benefits of the wizards' training, but you will gain more respect in the eyes of sorcerers and wizards."
msgstr ""
"我是首席法师，负责巫师的升职。你们没有一个人是巫师。但我做人很公正，如果你们能找到魔法喷泉，我赐予你们荣誉法师头衔。你们没有法师的法术，但会获得巫师和法师的尊敬。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"I can't believe those Silver Helms wanted to kill me!\n"
"I've never done anything wrong in my life!\n"
"Well, nothing more wrong than any other mayor at least.\n"
"Thank you again for stopping them."
msgstr "真不敢相信银舵那帮人竟打算杀害我！我一辈子都没做错事！嗯，我是说至少和其他镇长相比不坏。实在感谢你阻止了他们的阴谋。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"I don't have much time to talk right now– I have a lot to do.\n"
"I'm in the process of organizing a few campaigns to attack the devils along the western coast.\n"
"You must realize, as I do, that nothing in all of Enroth poses as much of a threat to our safety as they do.\n"
"I only wish the other Lords would assist me by contributing supplies and troops, or just helping in the planning of these attacks.\n"
"They spend more time bickering amongst themselves over borders and laws and trade than in helping me deal with the REAL threat.\n"
"The devils have an advance post in Kriegspire near the Sentinels.\n"
"From here, they are able to base small raids and gather intelligence on our forces.\n"
"I need you to sneak in and attack it, find what information you can on the location of any devil strongholds and patrol patterns, and destroy the place.\n"
"Do not let any of the devils escape!\n"
"Surprise and secrecy are our greatest weapons."
msgstr ""
"我现在没时间多说了，我有许多事要做。我正在组建部队，攻击在西海岸的邪恶势力。你必须和我一样明白，他们才是恩洛斯安全真正的威胁。我希望其他贵族能在部队和供给方面助我一臂之力。或是帮我出谋划策。但他们总把时间花在领地，法律和贸易的争吵上，而对真正的威胁却无动于衷。恶魔们在圣蒂尼斯附近的克里格斯城堡建有前哨基地。从那儿派出小股部队，进行骚扰并窃取我军情报。我想派你潜入敌人基地，取得必要得情报并摧毁该基地。不要放走一个恶魔。记住，出其不意，攻其不备是我们的制胜法宝。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"I grow tired of winter.\n"
"In my lands, winter seems to last year round.\n"
"As a matter of fact, for the last few years, summer didn't arrive at all.\n"
"I have come to believe that something is wrong with the weather, and I want something done about it.\n"
"I know your reputation, and I hear you can do anything.\n"
"I have a deal for you.\n"
"End the winter in my land and I will give you my support in the High Council when it comes time for you to ask for it.\n"
"If it's any help at all, I hear there is hermit on a mountaintop somewhere west of here who has studied the weather in detail."
msgstr ""
"我已经无法忍受严冬的折磨了，在我的国土上，冬天是最讨厌的季节。事实上这些年来夏日的阳光从未照耀这片国土。我想一定是季节变换出了什么毛病，我一定要找出原因。你的大名我已如雷贯耳，听说你无所不能，我想和你做笔交易。你把冬天赶走，我将在高级议会里全力支持你。我听说西北某处的山头上有位世外高人，对于节气变化有相当的研究。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"I happen to know that you are amongst a short list of adventurers looking to receive favor from the High Council.\n"
"What you want it for I don't know, nor do I care.\n"
"I'll be blunt:\n"
"I love money, and I want more.\n"
"Much more.\n"
"I have a plan to fix the price of shipping in my favor for a time and I need competent agents to carry it out.\n"
"Perform this task well and I will give you my support, not to mention a lot of money.\n"
"Here is the plan:\n"
"Each of the nine shipping companies in the Kingdom must be convinced to charge at least 48 gold per pound per mile of material they transport.\n"
"They are all in competition and they know it, so none will want to make a move before the others.\n"
"I don't care how you convince them– just get the job done and report back to me."
msgstr ""
"我碰巧知道你是冒险者清单上的一员，希望得到高级议会的垂青。我并不知道也不关心你到底需要什么。我是个直率的人，我喜欢钱，钱越多越好。我需要一个有能力的代理商使船费在一定期间内固定，这样我就可获利。如果你能完成这一计划，我会在议会给予你充分的支持，并给你丰厚的报酬。具体计划如下：使王国的九个船公司中都同意每磅货物每英里的运价保持在48 个金币以上。他们都知道竞争非常激烈，必须保持同一价格，没人会愿意波动价格。我不管你采取什么方法使他们都同。只要你完成这一任务，就回来向我报告。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"I have a few theories about the undead that I would very much like to prove.\n"
"What I really need is the remains of an undead creature, preferably a powerful one.\n"
"Actually, what I really need is the remains of the FIRST lich, Ethric the Mad.\n"
"I am a scholar, however, and don't have the means to gain such a specimen.\n"
"I do have some money saved up, and I'd be willing to pay you well for Ethric's remains."
msgstr ""
"我钻研出了一些灵魂不死的理论，并想验证这些理论。我现在需要一具不死生物的残骸，最好是个强大的。其实，史上第一个巫妖——疯子埃斯里克的残骸，那是最好不过了。我只是个书生，没有能力得到他的残骸。但我存了些钱，如果你能帮我得到埃斯里克的残骸，我会酬谢你的。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"I have no information on his whereabouts, so it will do you no good to talk to me about it.\n"
"Try going to Free Haven and asking around.\n"
"He must have a hideout somewhere in or near that town.\n"
"<Smiling> if you find where he's living, be sure to check under the bed and in the closet– you'll probably find him hiding under a pile of clothes."
msgstr ""
"我对他的行踪一无所知，你问我也是白问。去自由天堂问问吧，他在城市附近肯定有个据点。< 微笑> 如果你找到他的住处，千万别忘了检查床底下和衣柜里，他说不定就藏在衣服堆里。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"I knew my faith in you was well placed!\n"
"You have fixed a major problem in our kingdom, not to mention doing yourself a favor—It's now safe to fly above towns.\n"
"It is my pleasure to promote all warrior mages to master archers, and all honorary warrior mages to honorary master archers."
msgstr ""
"我已经完全信任你了。你解决了我们王国最关键的问题，而且还毫不居功。现在我们可以自由地在城镇上空任意飞行了。我很荣幸把你们中的战斗法师升级为神箭手，荣誉战斗法师升级为荣誉神箭手。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"I know there is a shortage of damsels in distress, but this quest is the traditional test.\n"
"I really can't bend the rules here.\n"
"Keep looking– I'm sure you'll find someone.\n"
"If it helps, I hear Melody Silver, daughter of the noble John Silver, is being held captive by ruffians on the Island of Mist."
msgstr ""
"我知道这里很少有少女处于危难之中。但这规矩是自古以来延续下来的，我不能坏了规距。再努力一把吧，我相信你会成功的。我曾听说贵族约翰·席尔瓦的女儿米拉达·席尔瓦被浓雾岛上的一伙强盗绑架了，你不妨去试一试。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"I like it up here.\n"
"It's as though I can watch the world turn from up high and all alone.\n"
"Serene.\n"
"Untouchable.\n"
"Almost…Prophetic.\n"
"I can see the clouds churn and travel, break apart and mix together.\n"
"I can predict the weather almost perfectly.\n"
"<Smiling> Right now, I predict more snow."
msgstr ""
"我喜欢这个世界熙熙攘攘的热闹景象。在这里我目睹了喧闹的世界变成死寂一片的全过程。多么沉寂，冰冷得令人不敢靠近。这几乎是命中注定的。坐看着白云苍狗，起伏不定，风起云涌，变幻莫测。我对天气的预测几乎百发百中。< 微笑> 现在，我预感暴风雪将更加猖獗肆虐。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"I need proof that Snergle has been defeated.\n"
"I'm sorry, but I just can't take your word for it.\n"
"Bring back some personal item of his, like his axe maybe."
msgstr "我需要你证明斯纳格已经被打败了，很抱歉我不能相信你的一面之词。你最好能带回斯纳格的私人物品来证明，比如他的战斧。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"I sometimes have the worst trouble trying to remember things I've learned.\n"
"I'm not sure why this is, but I've discovered a way around the problem.\n"
"I am going to create a mirror that will allow me to look back in time, so that I can remember what it is I've forgotten.\n"
"To do this, I need the Hourglass of Time, but my duties and research prevent me from searching for the hourglass on my own.\n"
"The hourglass is said to be in a dark cavern up near area… <pauses a moment>\n"
"No, that was the Spear of Darkness…\n"
"where is the hourglass?\n"
"<pauses again>\n"
"I should be able to remember this.\n"
"<snaps his fingers>\n"
"Of course!\n"
"It's buried in an old fort to the south of here.\n"
"I can offer you my support in the council if you will help me in creating my mirror."
msgstr ""
"我老是健忘，有时连自己所学的东西都记不起来。真不知道为什么。后来我发现了解决这个毛病的方法。我要发明一面镜子，通过它能回到过去，找到我遗忘的东西。镜子必须由时间沙漏磨成，但我的研究工作太忙了，抽不出空去找这东西。时间沙漏据说是在某个地方附近的黑暗洞穴里。< 沉默片刻> 不对，那是黑暗之矛藏的地方。< 沉默片刻> 我应该记得它在哪里的。< 打个响指> 对了，它埋在这儿南面的古堡里。如果你帮助我制造魔镜，我就在议会里支持你。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"I think I might just allow the Fraternal Order of Silver to police the areas around Mist.\n"
"Maybe they'd be able to hunt down all the evil people and leave this island a paradise."
msgstr "我也许应该让银色兄弟会管理浓雾镇及周边地区。他们有能力扫清所有恶势力，使浓雾岛成为人间天堂。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"I try to sell things like this {item} for {a#} gold. But we both know it's really worth {b#}. So that's my price."
msgstr "像{item}这样的东西我一般卖 {a#} 金币。不过咱们都清楚它其实值 {b#}，就这个价吧。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "I try to sell things like this {item} for {listed} gold. "
msgstr "这种{item}我一般卖 {listed} 金币。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"I was captured in the center of the Mad Necromancer's lab.\n"
"There I was tortured and many curses were placed upon me.\n"
" Ebonest must have been taken from me when I fell, and perhaps is still in the central chamber.\n"
"If you were to recover it and return it to Quixote, at least my family name will be cleared, and my daughter can continue her life without my failure haunting her."
msgstr ""
"我刚好在疯狂死灵法师实验室的正中央被俘虏，我在那边遭到无数的拷打和诅咒。艾邦斯特屠龙枪一定是在我倒下的时候被夺走了，也许它现在还在同样的地方。如果你能够找回艾邦斯特屠龙枪，并且将它拿回去给吉柯德，至少你可以协助洗清我的污名，而且我的女儿不需要因为我的失败而继续过着被鄙视的生活。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"I was once the court magician, long ago.\n"
"That all ended when Archibald… disrupted… things.\n"
"Archibald had acquired some skill as a sorcerer and had knowledge of spells beyond that taught to magicians today, and therefore didn't require my services.\n"
"Since then, I've lived in this little shack, conducted my own research, and have grown old."
msgstr ""
"很久以前我曾是宫廷魔法师。但自从阿基巴德犯上作乱后，一切都变得面目全非。阿基巴德作为巫师拥有傲世群伦的魔法技能。他掌握了几项现已失传的咒语，所以再也不需要我了。从此我隐居在此潜心钻研我的魔法，任凭岁月流逝，消蚀着我的生命。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"I was one of the mages studying at Kriegspire when the creatures there went completely out of control.\n"
"In my escape from the castle, I left a valuable item behind, a jeweled egg.\n"
"This egg is a family heirloom that goes back in my family as far as the Silence.\n"
"I have tried a few times to get it back, but the creatures there are too powerful for me.\n"
"I'd gladly trade a generous sum of money to get my egg back."
msgstr ""
"当克里格斯城堡的怪兽造反时，我正在那里学习魔法。我立即逃离该城堡，匆忙中把一颗价值连城的宝石蛋忘在那里。这颗宝石蛋是我们家的传家宝，从寂静时代流传至今。我屡次想夺回宝石蛋，但怪兽警卫森严，我又不是他们的对手。谁能替我把宝石蛋夺回来，我就重重赏他。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "I'll tell you what it is for {n#} gold pieces."
msgstr "付 {n#} 个金币，我就告诉你这是什么。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"I'm glad to see you again, but the Celestial Order is still in the Monolith."
msgstr "很高兴再次见到你，但苍穹会仍占据着独立碑。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but I still haven't remembered exactly what it is you need.\n"
"I know you need to search Corlagon's Estate."
msgstr "很抱歉，我真忘了你需要什么了。我只知道你要搜查考勒根的豪宅。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"I'm still looking for the mirror. <pauses> I mean Hourglass… I keep getting those mixed up.\n"
"Did you try the dark cavern– no wait, it was the old fort south of here.\n"
"I always seem to mix those up."
msgstr "我仍在找魔镜，< 沉默> 我的意思是指找时间沙漏。我把它们混一块了。你黑暗洞穴去过没有，不，你南面的古堡去过没有，我老是把东西混在一起。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"I've discovered a way to reverse the effects of time and make myself young again.\n"
"This requires a complex magical ritual, which I've worked out.\n"
"The problem is that I need to place magical statuettes on various pedestals. The tiger statuette goes on the pedestal near Sweet Water, the bear statuette in Kriegspire, the eagle statuette in Dragonsand, the wolf statuette in the Mire of the Damned, and the dragon statuette in Bootleg Bay.\n"
"The distances are too far for me to travel in my old age, and in the meantime I need to prepare the ritual itself.\n"
"There is no way I can do all of this on my own; I need your help.\n"
"The statuettes are in the chest outside my house.\n"
"Place them on the pedestals and return to me.\n"
"Even if the ritual is a failure, I'll pay you for your efforts."
msgstr ""
"我研制出一种魔法可以使时间倒转，让我重获青春。这需要进行一项复杂的仪式。我知道如何进行这项仪式。但问题是我需要把这些魔法小雕像放各地的底座上。虎像放在甜水镇；熊像放在克里格斯镇；鹰像放在飞龙沙漠；狼像放在幽灵沼泽；龙像放在布特雷格湾。我年纪大了，走不了这么远的路，而且我还要准备仪式，没法自己亲自完成整个程序，我需要你的帮助。小雕像就在我屋子外面的箱子里，把它们放到各地相应的底座上，即使实验失败了，你回来后我仍会重重酬谢你的。"

