# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Insanity, and the party restarts at level 1, maps reach level 500, bosses are seeded and every death counts, including loading during combat. No mercenaries. Horizontal progression; masteries need skill 10, 24 and 40."
msgstr ""
"在疯狂之路基础上，队伍从 1 级重新开始，地图最高 500 级，首领固定生成，每次死亡都会被记录——包括战斗中读档。无雇佣兵。横向成长曲线；宗师级需要技能等级 10、24、40。"

