# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Interesting.\n"
"The Dragoons were hired by the Shadow Guild.\n"
"I'm certain Anthony Stone will want to hear about this.\n"
"I'll present this letter when I see him next. Thank you for this.\n"
"I'm sure he will want to take action against the Shadow Guild now that we have some proof of their deeds."
msgstr ""
"真有意思，阴影教竟然雇佣龙骑兵。我想安东尼·斯通肯定想了解这个消息。下次见到他时，我会把这封信给他看的。现在我们有了证据，斯通会对阴影教采取行动的。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "Invisible"
msgstr "隐形"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "Is Ready"
msgstr "已就绪"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Is there no hope for us?\n"
"Please promise me you'll keep searching for a way to reverse the curse and turn us back to normal people."
msgstr "我们真的没希望了吗？求求你想个办法解除咒语把我们变为正常人吧。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"It was my pleasure to serve under Lord Balthazar, he was the finest herd leader in my tribe's history.\n"
"Unfortunately, my services were pledged to the Merchants of Alvar, or I may have been in the battle where Balthazar fell.\n"
"Perhaps my ability and my axe could have saved my lord.\n"
"We'll never know now."
msgstr ""
"在巴尔萨煞大王底下服务是我的荣幸，他是我族中历史上最强悍的领导者。很不幸地，我的忠诚目前已经献给了阿尔瓦的商人，不然也许我当年可以加入巴尔萨煞大人失败的那场战争。也许我的斧头和我的技巧可以救他一命，谁知道呢？"

