# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Kriegspire is the castle inside the volcano.\n"
"We mages were forced to raise the earth around the castle to try and prevent the creatures from overrunning the surrounding towns.\n"
"Now they're contained inside, and that's where the egg is."
msgstr ""
"克里格斯城堡是一座火山中的城堡。我们魔法师们害怕怪兽危害周围的城镇，就把城堡周围的泥土堆积起来不让他们出来。现在他们就在城堡里，而宝石蛋也在里面。"

