# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"My father Blazen, left here years ago to slay the Skeletal Dragons in the Shadowspire Region. Unfortunately, he has never returned.\n"
"He took with him, Ebonest, the greatest Dragon slaying spear ever forged. Charles Quixote has never forgiven my father for taking Ebonest with him.\n"
"Unfortunately we have no idea what befell my father.\n"
"Because my father was Charles' second in command and responsible for the loss of Ebonest, Charles is unwilling to promote me to Champion, regardless of the merit of my skills. Perhaps if you find Ebonest, Charles with promote your knights and myself to Champions!"
msgstr ""
"我的父亲布拉森几年以前离开这里，要去除掉影旋山脉地区的骷髅龙。很不幸的，他再也没有回来过。他把史上最强的屠龙兵器——艾邦斯特屠龙枪一起带去了。查尔斯·吉柯德因为这件事而无法原谅我的父亲。很遗憾地，我们不知道我的父亲到底遭遇到了什么样的命运。由于我的父亲是查尔斯的副手，因此他必须要为了艾邦斯特屠龙枪遗失的意外负责，因此查尔斯不愿意将我晋升为勇士，即使我的技能和表现都已经符合了水准也没办法。如果你能够找到艾邦斯特屠龙枪，也许查尔斯会把你队伍中的骑士和我一起晋升为勇士！"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"My gratitude!\n"
"My wife loves this harp; I'm so glad you were able to recover it!\n"
"Here, take this as a reward.\n"
"I've heard rumors that the Dragoons were working with the Shadow Guild.\n"
"If that's the case, I'm sure the Mayor of New Sorpigal would love to see proof of it.\n"
"Thank you again for your assistance."
msgstr ""
"万分感谢！我的妻子对这把竖琴喜爱极了，很高兴你把它完璧归赵。这是你的报酬。我听说龙骑兵在为阴影教做事。如果真有此事，新索匹格的镇长一定想要看到证据。再次感谢你对我的帮助。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"My husband, Emmanuel, went to Star Island a few weeks ago with a few friends hoping to find some treasure.\n"
"I haven't seen him since, and I'm worried about him.\n"
"I don't dare go to the island; it's rumored to be the home of medusas!\n"
"If you could find him and bring him home, I would be very grateful."
msgstr ""
"我的丈夫埃曼纽尔前些天和他的几个朋友去星岛寻找财宝。从那以后再也没见到他们，几天来一直为此而忧心忡忡。我不敢上那个岛，传言那是美杜莎女妖的老巢。如果你能找到他并把他带回来，我将感激不尽。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"My niece, Melody, has been kidnapped from her home in Mist and locked in a Silver Helm outpost near there.\n"
"She's one of the few people who know that I've been murdered.\n"
"I'm sure Gerrard has her locked up for that reason, but I believe he wants to force her into marriage to eliminate any opposition to his leadership of the Fraternal Order of Silver."
msgstr ""
"我的侄女米拉达在浓雾岛被绑架，软禁在离岛不远处的银舵前哨内。她是极少数得知我已被害的知情者之一，肯定是因为这个，杰拉德绑架了她。他还逼我侄女与他成婚，以巩固他在银色兄弟会中的地位。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "Name: {v}"
msgstr "姓名：{v}"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Near here is a temple dedicated to the Order of the Fist.\n"
"I once belonged to that order, but recently they uncovered a powerful evil crystal.\n"
"They hope to use the crystal as a bargaining chip to be accepted into the Temple of Baa.\n"
"I don't want to see the crystal fall into Baa's hands– it must be destroyed.\n"
"Please infiltrate the temple and destroy the crystal."
msgstr ""
"附近有一处神拳会的庙宇。我曾是它的成员。最近他们发现了一颗能量强大的邪恶水晶。他们想以此为讨价还价的筹码申请加入羊鸣教。但我不想见到水晶落入羊鸣教的魔掌，必须毁掉它。请潜入庙里毁了那颗水晶。"

