msgid ""
"Normally, I do my best to buy a {item} for {a#} gold. But I can see you know it's worth {b#}. Agreed?"
msgstr "一般来说，{item}我最多出 {a#} 金币。不过看得出你知道它值 {b#}。成交吗？"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "Normally, I do my best to buy a {item} for {listed} gold. "
msgstr "通常我会尽力用 {listed} 金币收下{item}。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Not all of the companies have agreed to raise their prices!\n"
"Why do you return only to report incompetence?\n"
"There are large profits I could be reaping if you had done your job and convinced these idiots to raise their prices!\n"
"MUST I DO THIS MYSELF?\n"
"Should I send someone else?\n"
"Why do I surround myself with MORONS?!\n"
"So far I have lost a lot of gold because you haven't finished your job!\n"
"I'll deduct these losses from your final payment, you can be sure of that!"
msgstr ""
"并不是所有的船公司都同意提高价格。为什么你半途而废就回来报告？如果你完成了任务使这些傻瓜都同意得提高价格，我就可以获得暴利。难道我必须亲自出马吗？我还应该另派他人？为什么我的周围都是低能儿？你别高兴，由于你未能完成任务使我损失了巨额财产，我的损失将从你的工资中扣除。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "Not enough food"
msgstr "食物不足"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
