msgstr "食物不足：在此存档需要 {n#} 份。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Now all I have to do is remember how to create the mirror.\n"
"I wrote down all the important parts so I wouldn't forget how to do it.\n"
"<stops> Where did I put those notes?\n"
"<ponders for a minute> I must have left them somewhere obvious, maybe in the laboratory.\n"
"Anyway, your part in this is done, and again I thank you.\n"
"You will have my complete support in the council for this.\n"
"What were your names again?"
msgstr ""
"现在我得回忆怎么制造魔镜。我已经把重要细节记在纸上以免遗忘。< 停顿> 我把纸条放哪儿了？< 沉思片刻> 我肯定放在什么显眼地方了。也许在实验室里。你已经完成了任务，真是万分感谢。我将在议会里全力支持你，再问一遍，你叫什么名字？"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Now wait just a minute Tanir, and I'll make it worth your while to let me…Oh. <Archibald is silent for a long while> I guess I have you people to thank for releasing me from my prison of stone.\n"
"Thank you!\n"
"You say you need a spell that I've created?\n"
"<reaching to the shelves and removing a library scroll> Well, as a reward, I'll give you the Ritual of the Void.\n"
"Use it in good health.\n"
"Now, I'm sure you're very busy, as am I…<Archibald waves his arms and fades away>"
msgstr ""
"等一下，坦耐尔，只要你让我……哟，< 阿基巴德沉默了好一阵子> 很感谢你把我从石头的禁锢中解救出来。你说你需要一个我发明的咒语？< 阿基巴德从书柜中抽出一个卷轴> 好，我把虚空仪式书送给你，做为回报。好好用它吧。所以现在，你肯定很忙，我也是…< 阿基巴德挥了挥手就无影无踪了>"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Number keys on the inventory page and in shops and chests; Shift with a number does the other. A party"
msgstr "在物品栏、商店与箱子界面使用数字键；按住 Shift 再按数字键可执行另一种操作。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Of course I would know Balthazar's Axe if I saw it!\n"
"Do you have it with you? This IS the axe!\n"
"You must take this back to Tessalar, so the Rite's of Purity may be performed upon the axe, so it be made ready for the son of Balthazar, Masul.\n"
"Take this letter with you, it carries my personal seal, and statement that this is indeed the Axe of Balthazar!"
msgstr ""
"如果我看到了巴尔萨煞之斧，我当然认得出来！你身上有带吗？这的确就是那柄斧头！你一定要赶快带回去进行净化之仪式，好让这柄斧头能够继承给巴尔萨煞的儿子马苏尔。把这封信一起带回去，上面有我个人专属的封缄，证明这的确是巴尔萨煞之斧！"

