msgstr "残破镇船坞旁的食人妖"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Oh dear!\n"
"You haven't found her yet?\n"
"Surely she must have been sacrificed or eaten or something.\n"
"Please try to find her, or at least avenge her death."
msgstr "哦，亲爱的，你还没找到她吗？她准是被祭天了，要么就是被吃了。请务必找到她，要是她已经不在人世了，请为她报仇。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Oh, glorious day!\n"
"With Snergle's passing, we can now search for Rocklin to put him back in power.\n"
"Eternal thanks to you for this, and dwarves everywhere owe you a debt of gratitude."
msgstr "啊，真是一个光荣的日子！斯纳格已经倒台了，现在我们可以找回洛克林国王让他重登王位。我们永远感激你，矮人国的所有民众都欠你一个人情。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Oh, thank you for bringing Emmanuel back to me!\n"
"Nothing in this world means as much to me as him!\n"
"Please take this as a reward.\n"
"I know it's not much, but you deserve it for bringing him back to me."
msgstr "哦，感谢你把埃曼纽尔带回我的身边。在这个世界上他对我来说意味着一切。请收下我的报酬，虽然不多，但聊表心意。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Only Masul, our herd leader, can deem an individual worthy of the title of Minotaur Lord.\n"
"One way to prove your worth, would be to recover his father's axe, the Axe of Balthazar from the bowels of the Mines of the Dark Dwarfs.\n"
"Set your feet upon the path of this quest, and great is you future!\n"
"But we must be sure that the axe you find is indeed the Axe of Balthazar.\n"
"Take the Axe to Dadeross, a Minotaur in the service of the Merchants of Alvar, on the island of Dagger Wound.\n"
"He will be able to verify the truth of what you find."
msgstr ""
"只有我们目前的领袖马苏尔可以判断一个人到底值不值得获得牛头领主的称号。其中一个获得他青睐的方法是找到他父亲的斧头，也就是遗落在黑暗矮人矿坑之底的巴尔萨煞之斧。只要你出发去完成这个任务，你的未来就光明可期。但是你必须要确认这的确是巴尔萨煞之斧。把你找到的斧头带去给达德洛斯，也就是阿尔瓦商队中的一名牛头人。他就在匕伤群岛上。他将可以判断你所找到的斧头是否货真价实。"

