# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Our town is periodically plagued by giant spiders.\n"
"I'm pretty sure that if the spider queen were killed, the rest of the spiders would go away.\n"
"Currently, I'm offering a reward to the person that can kill the spider queen."
msgstr "我的城镇总不时被巨型蜘蛛抢劫掠夺。我很确信如果把蜘蛛女王杀了，剩下的余党就会不战而逃了。现在我正在重金寻找能杀死蜘蛛女王的勇士。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Our town is under a terrible curse, though most people don't believe it.\n"
"Under a full moon, we all change into werewolves.\n"
"Although none of us are truly evil, we don't really know what sort of horrible things we do as werewolves.\n"
"We can't approach our lord, Acton Spindler about the problem because he doesn't realize that we are the werewolves.\n"
"Please find a way to turn us back to normal!"
msgstr ""
"我们的镇子正被一个可怕的诅咒笼罩着，尽管大多数人都不相信这个事实。在满月之际，我们全都会变成狼人。虽然我们都不是恶人，但我们并不知道自己变成狼人后做了什么可怕的事情。我们也不方便把这事禀告艾克顿·斯宾德勒爵士，他现在还并没有意识到我们就是那些狼人。请你想方设法让我们恢复正常吧！"

