msgid ""
"Several of the warriors got together to go take care of the ogres that were camping on the road to Ravenshore.\n"
"That's when we first had word of the fortress they were constructing to the southwest of here.\n"
"Since the fortress was completed the roads to the south and west have not been safe."
msgstr ""
"曾经有几名战士成群结队地准备对付那些在渡鸦海滨道路附近兴建要塞的食人妖。这是我们第一次听说他们在西南方建造的要塞。从要塞完成之后，往西和往南的道路就都变得不安全了。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
