# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"So this is the legendary Mordred, eh?\n"
"Interesting, I was expecting something much grander.\n"
"I don't think I want it, actually.\n"
"Why don't you keep it, and I'll deal with my friend on the cost."
msgstr "啊？这就是极富传奇色彩的莫德里德？有意思，我还指望它会更神奇些呢。我对这玩意儿兴趣不大，你拿着吧，钱我自己会向我的朋友商量的。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"So you are the Lords of Harmondale, eh?\n"
"You don't look like much; we shall see how history judges you!\n"
"I myself am a historian and collector of rare historical items.\n"
"Lord Markham also collects such items of interest and there is one item in particular that would complete my collection, Parson's Quill-- the Quill used to sign the Treaty of Pierpont ending the first Timber War.\n"
"I know you have dealt with Lord Markham before, it's how you became Lords of this land after all, and if you would take this letter to Lord Markham in Tatalia, I'm sure he would respond favorably.\n"
"I would be even more in your debt if Lord Markham sends this item back with you!\n"
"I would be sure to favorably record your heroic acts and deeds!"
msgstr ""
"啊，你们就是和谐谷城堡的新主人！看起来不怎么象。不过象不象不是我说了算的，老百姓自有评判。我是个历史学家，还是个历史文物的收藏爱好者。听说马克汉姆爵士在这方面和我是同道，他有一件非常珍贵的收藏--- 帕尔森的羽毛笔。那可不是普通的羽毛笔，结束第一次木材战争时签署匹尔邦特和平协议用的就是这支笔。你们既然能成为和谐谷的主人，和马克汉姆爵士的交情肯定不错。麻烦你们把这封信带给他，他现在已经住在泰塔利亚了。如果爵士看了这封信，能把那支羽毛笔托你们交给我，那真是感激不尽，我一定会让您名垂青史。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"So, Sir John was murdered and the Silver Helms were bought off by the Temple of Baa?\n"
"That explains a great deal.\n"
"Good work on bringing this to me, but you'll need to collect your reward from Anthony Stone."
msgstr ""
"所以说，约翰爵士被杀害了，银舵已经被羊鸣教收买了？那倒是解释了过去发生的很多事。你们把这个带给我，干得真不错，不过你们得去安东尼·斯通那儿拿取报酬。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"So, Stromgard needs a miracle with the weather, eh?\n"
"All this time I thought he was the one responsible for making it snow continually.\n"
"I can break the enchantment on the weather easily, and if you hurry back to him, I'm sure you can claim responsibility."
msgstr ""
"斯壮姆嘉德希望看到奇迹能使气候有所变化？我一直认为这场暴风雪是对着他来的。但是破解这种异常的天气对我来说轻而易举。你快赶回去吧，还可以赶得上邀功领赏。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "Sold {item} for {n#} gold."
msgstr "以 {n#} 金币卖出了{item}。"

