# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "Southern Village Group in Harmondale"
msgstr "和谐谷南部村落群"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"So…you wish to become an Assassin.\n"
"Very well.\n"
"I can provide the Rogues among you the training necessary, but you must prove both your skill and your loyalty before I will invest time in you.\n"
"My superiors inform me that a certain Lady Eleanor Carmine's life must end.\n"
"She used to work for us, but has taken up residence in the Celestial Court with our enemies, and is providing them with information damaging to our cause.\n"
"Silence her, and return with a trinket of hers to prove the job is done."
msgstr ""
"哦，你们要成为杀手，好吧，不过我只能把你们之中的神偷提拔为杀手，而且你们还得完成我交给你们的任务，以证明你们的忠诚和能力，不然就别来浪费我的时间了。我接到命令，必须干掉埃利诺·卡米尔这个臭女人。她原来也是我们一伙的，现在她竟然投靠了我们的敌人，泄露了不少机密，真是太可恶了。她就住在赛勒斯提的通天院，把她从伊拉西亚蒸发掉，这个任务就交给你们了。记住完成任务后别忘了把她身上的匕首带回来，有了它作证据我就可以提拔你们了。"

