# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Thank you for releasing me.\n"
"The only thing keeping the Silver Helms from killing me was the fact I'm a priest.\n"
"Frankly, I'm surprised they would show me any mercy at all.\n"
"Listen, I've heard some strange sounds coming from around here… I think there might be a hidden passage near here.\n"
"In any event, I should probably be leaving now; I don't want to stay in this cell any longer."
msgstr ""
"感谢你解救了我。我想也许因为我是神甫，银舵才没有对我下毒手。说实话，我真奇怪他们怎么还有点仁慈之心。我听到周围传来奇怪的声音，我想这里肯定隐藏着秘密。我现在该走了，这鬼地方我一刻也不想呆了。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Thank you for rescuing me from these horrible ruffians!\n"
"I'd like to go back home to New Sorpigal now."
msgstr "感谢你把我从这些可恶的歹徒手中营救出来！现在我想要回新索匹格我的家乡。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Thank you for returning this egg to me; it's the most precious thing I have."
msgstr "感谢你夺回了宝石蛋，它对我来说是最宝贵的东西。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Thank you for saving my niece.\n"
"Behind this wall is a secret area I've kept hidden from even Gerrard all these years.\n"
"You are welcome to take whatever you want; I'd prefer you have this than Gerrard."
msgstr "感谢你救了我的侄女。这堵墙后面是我连杰拉德也未透露的密室，你可以任意拿取你需要的东西。与其留给杰拉德，我更愿意让你带走。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Thank you for turning me back to normal. I'd love to stay and chat, but I really should be getting out of here."
msgstr "感谢你使我恢复原形，我乐意坐下来聊聊，但现在必须离开这鬼地方。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Thank you so much for bringing me these letters! <Wilbur begins reading the letters> I've been so worried…I see… This is not good news…Oh, no.\n"
"Traitors!\n"
"Traitors and conspirators everywhere!\n"
"I must organize an expedition at once! <Wilbur lowers his voice> I trust you will not speak to the prince about these letters– he is already too depressed and unhappy to hear more bad news.\n"
"And now I must see to the organization of the expedition.\n"
"Here is a bag of gold as a reward– you've earned it and my gratitude.\n"
"Now, if only I could find someone to finish looking for Lord Kilburn…"
msgstr ""
"感谢你给我梢来这些信。< 威尔伯开始读信> 。我的担心由来已久。真是不幸。哦，不，叛徒，到处是叛徒和阴谋家。我必须立刻组织远征军。< 威尔伯降低嗓音> 我想你不会把这些信告诉王子的。他一直给郁郁寡欢，情绪低沉，不能再受这些消息打击了。现在我必须召集远征军将领。这袋金币是给你的报酬。我对你很满意。现在我要物色个人去寻找科尔本爵士。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Thank you so much for saving Sharry!\n"
"I can't tell you how much this means to both New Sorpigal and myself.\n"
"You have our gratitude forever."
msgstr "十分感谢你搭救了雪莱！你为整个新索匹格作出了难以估量的贡献。我们对你的恩情将永远铭记在心。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Thank you!\n"
"We can now sleep at night without worrying about what kinds of foul acts we will commit as monsters!\n"
"It's a tragedy that our lord was a werewolf himself; he'll be sorely missed.\n"
"Please accept this for your help, and for believing in us."
msgstr ""
"太谢谢你了。现在我们晚上可以平平安安的睡觉了，用不着担心会像野兽一样夜晚四处游荡为非作歹。真不幸连爵士自己都被变成了狼人，我们会怀念他的。为了感谢你对我们的信任和帮助，请收下这些。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "That player is {cond}"
msgstr "该角色正处于{cond}"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "The Castle of Air"
msgstr "空气城堡"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "The Castle of Fire"
msgstr "火焰城堡"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"The Dragoons that have been plaguing the roads around here recently stole a harp of mine from one of my caravans.\n"
"I'm not strong enough to get it back from them, but I'm willing to pay someone capable to do it for me.\n"
"Find the harp and return it, and I'll reward you."
msgstr "龙骑兵在附近的道路上四处打劫，还抢劫我的商队，拿走了珍贵的竖琴。我可没能耐夺回我的竖琴，如果你能为我代劳，我会重重酬谢你的。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"The King of the Dwarves, Snergle, usurped Rocklin for leadership of the dwarven clans.\n"
"Now Rocklin is in exile somewhere and Snergle is in charge.\n"
"Most dwarves don't like Snergle and would like to see Rocklin back in power.\n"
"Unfortunately, Snergle has claimed both Rocklin's caverns and the largest dwarven Iron Mine.\n"
"Snergle, fearing treachery near home, has removed me, the Dwarven Weaponmaster, from my position.\n"
"We need someone to get Snergle out of power by any means necessary.\n"
"I'd even consider training you humans how to use an axe like a true dwarf if you'll help us."
msgstr ""
"现任的矮人国国王斯纳格是谋权篡位后登上矮人国王位的。原国王洛克林被他放逐边疆。大多数矮人国的民众不堪忍受斯纳格的残暴统制，都希望洛克林能重登王位。不幸的是，斯纳格占据了洛克林的岩洞和矮人国最大的铁矿。他为了巩固王位，撤了我矮人国武器大师的职位。我们需要有人帮助，使用任何手段把斯纳格赶下台。如果你能助我们一臂之力，尽管你是人类，我也会把矮人擅使的战斧绝招传授给你。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"The Mayor here in Mist is considering allowing the Fraternal Order of Silver to police the town in their battle against evil.\n"
"I know the Silver Helm Persecution Squads have murdered innocents in their misguided crusade against 'evil,' but there are no living witnesses to their atrocities.\n"
"I need you to storm their outpost to the south of here to find proof so that I can convince the mayor to ban them from Mist."
msgstr ""
"浓雾镇的镇长正考虑在与恶势力的战斗期间让银色兄弟会来管理整个城镇。但我知道银色兄弟会下属的银舵除奸队打着“向恶势力进军”的旗号杀戮了许多无辜的人。遗憾的是，没有幸存的目击者佐证他们的暴行。你的任务是突袭本镇东南边他们的前哨站，搜索证据，让我可以说服镇长取缔他们。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "The Necromancer in party slot"
msgstr "队伍位置上的死灵法师"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"The Regnans are the worst slime to ever set foot on the shore of Jadame. They keep the peoples of this continent from trading with Erathia and Enroth.\n"
"What choice do we have?\n"
"Even the Merchants of Alvar couldn't muster a fleet to deal with the pirates.\n"
"Rumor says that there are smugglers around that have found ways around the pirate blockades."
msgstr ""
"雷格那人是贾丹姆大陆附近海域上最糟糕的流氓。他们让这个大陆上的人们无法和伊拉西亚和恩洛斯的人们贸易。我们有什么选择呢？即使连阿尔瓦的商人公会都无法召集够大的舰队来对付他们。谣传私枭们找到了方法可以躲过这些海盗的阻挡。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"The Regnans call themselves the Empire of the Endless Ocean--trying to make more of themselves than there really is.\n"
"All they are is bullies and bandits.\n"
"Of course, don't tell them that I said that!"
msgstr "雷格那人称自己属于无尽之海的帝国。这只不过是虚张声势而已。他们只不过是流氓和强盗而已。当然，你千万别跟他们说这句话是我说的！"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "The Titan Stronghold"
msgstr "泰坦要塞"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "The Vampyre Lounge "
msgstr "吸血鬼酒廊"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"The doors became warded when a strange creature came to reside here.\n"
"I am not familiar with this type of being, and I've seen many types in my long time here in Enroth.\n"
"I do not know why it chose this place as its home, or why there is only one, but I would like to see it destroyed for the trouble it has caused me."
msgstr ""
"自从一个奇怪的生物来此定居后，这几扇门就被魔力锁住了。我在恩洛斯大陆上活了这么久，千奇百怪的东西见过不少，却不知这个生物是什么玩意儿。真不明白为什么它会在这里定居，为什么它仅此一只。我希望有人把它给除掉，它给我带来了不少麻烦。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"The hourglass wasn't there?\n"
"Oh, that's right!\n"
"I knew I forgot something!\n"
"The key is in there!\n"
"You use the key to open the Forge of… <pauses>\n"
"Well, I can't remember whose forge it is, but that is the resting place of the Hourglass of Time...I think.\n"
"It can't hurt to look there, especially now that you've found the key.\n"
"<pauses>\n"
"At least I THINK that's what the key opens.\n"
"Anyway, that forge or laboratory or whatever it is can be found on the islands north of New Sorpigal.\n"
"Good Luck!"
msgstr ""
"什么，时间沙漏不在那儿。哦，对了。我忘了件事。我忘把钥匙给你了。你用钥匙打开古堡< 停顿> 我记不清那是谁的古堡了，但我想那是时间沙漏的唯一藏身地。千万别硬闯，特别是你现在有了钥匙。< 停顿> 至少我想这把钥匙能打开古堡大门。你去新索匹格北面岛上的古堡，实验室，或是其它什么地方找找看。祝你好运！"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "The innkeeper fills your packs to {d} days."
msgstr "店主把你们的口粮补到了 {d} 天。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "The last check failed: "
msgstr "上次检查失败："

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "The last check failed: {message}"
msgstr "上次检查失败：{message}"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"The night the stranger came through here was the same night that the crystal erupted in the center of town.\n"
"I only caught a glimpse of the stranger.\n"
"He didn't appear the potent mage that he was.\n"
"I was not in the town square when he summoned the crystal, but I did see the flash of light that traveled across the sky.\n"
"It was truly a terrible night."
msgstr ""
"陌生人出现的那天晚上，也就是这些诡异水晶出现的同一个晚上。我只看见那个陌生人的身影一眼，那看起来似乎没有多大的威胁。当他召唤出水晶的时候，我并不在城镇广场上，所以我并没有看见激射入天空的光芒。这真是恐怖的一夜。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"The palace is deadly dull, and everyone tells me what to do.\n"
"Being royalty isn't really worth much and no one will let me go outside the walls while my father is gone.\n"
"I haven't left the castle for months!\n"
"Anyway, you people look pretty important.\n"
"What if you helped me sneak out and stay with you for a couple of days?\n"
"I can't give you much in return yet, but I'll owe you a favor.\n"
"Someday I'll be able to repay you.\n"
"I am the prince, after all!\n"
"I'll go out the secret door and meet you outside."
msgstr ""
"皇宫里一点意思也没有，每个人都在教育我该怎么做。做王室成员根本不像想象的那么美好，自从父亲离开后，他们就没让我走出城墙。我呆在城堡里都好几个月了。你们似乎不是等闲之辈，带我溜出去和你们一起闯荡几天怎样？我没有多少报酬给你们，但我欠你们一个人情，有朝一日我会报答你们的。我毕竟还是个王子。我从密门溜出去和你们会合。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"The reason I wanted the key was to open the Dragon Towers and make the adjustments to prevent them from shooting flyers indiscriminately.\n"
"There is a way to adjust the towers to shoot at only large objects, and I want all of them adjusted for the good of the Kingdom.\n"
"Magic is becoming more common, as are stories of young Sorcerers getting shot from the sky because they didn't know the function of the towers.\n"
"You have the key.\n"
"If you adjust all of the towers to shoot at only large objects, I will promote all warrior mages amongst you to master archers and promote any honorary warrior mages to honorary master archers."
msgstr ""
"我要钥匙来进入龙塔的目的是为了阻止他们不分青红皂白，滥杀飞行生物。我们可以调节塔楼，使其只攻击大型怪兽。为了王国的利益，我要求所有的塔楼都要具有此项功能。由于一些修行不够的巫师们不知此塔楼的功能，他们常常遭到莫名其妙的攻击使魔法攻击力大减。现在你们有了钥匙。如果你们能使所有的塔楼只攻击大型飞行怪兽，我将把你们中的战斗法师升级为神箭手。你们中的荣誉战斗法师升级为荣誉神箭手。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"The sea of fire took us all by surprise.\n"
"It spread through the eastern half of the village like wildfire.\n"
"Luckily its growth seems to have slowed.\n"
"Still I don't know how much longer any of us can last."
msgstr ""
"火焰之湖是个让我们意料外的状况。它就像是野火一般地在村庄的东半边扩散。我们很幸运，因为它的扩散已经减缓下来了。但是我依然很怀疑我们到底还可以撑多久。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "The temple restores {name} for {gold} gold."
msgstr "神殿治疗了{name}，收费 {gold} 金币。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "The temple restores {who} for {n#} gold."
msgstr "神殿花费 {n#} 金币治好了{who}。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "The temple staff cannot treat {who}'s condition."
msgstr "神殿的人治不了{who}的状况。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "The temple staff says {who} is already well."
msgstr "神殿的人说{who}已经没事了。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "The town hall offers a reset: {r}"
msgstr "市政厅可提供重置：{r}"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "The town hall offers a reset: {what}"
msgstr "市政厅可提供重置：{what}"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "The {r} ruleset does not allow that change."
msgstr "{r}规则集不允许此更改。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Thee've done it! I knew thee could do it!\n"
"I'm so proud of thee!\n"
"Alice has been freed of the clutches of the wicked William Setag, evil has been vanquished, and good upheld.\n"
"Where once there was wrong, now there is right! [Charles sighs and smiles broadly] Well.\n"
"My work here is done!\n"
"Thee have passed the tests and deserve thy reward.\n"
"Therefore do I solemnly declare thee Heroes!"
msgstr ""
"你们成功了，我知道你们行的，真为你们骄傲。你们把埃莉斯从威廉姆·塞塔格的魔爪中救了出来，伸张正义，铲除邪恶，真是太了不起了。（查尔斯放声大笑）好了，你们已经完成了任务，证明了你们的能力，我宣布你们为伊拉西亚的英雄。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "Thieves guild"
msgstr "盗贼公会"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"This is April, the month of Endurance.\n"
"Journey to the Shrine of Frozen Highlands and pray there to be rewarded."
msgstr ""
"现在正是四月，耐力之月。\n"
"前往冰冻高原的神殿朝圣，必得回报。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"This is August, the month of Fire.\n"
"Journey to the Shrine of Kriegspire and pray there to be rewarded."
msgstr ""
"现在正是八月，火之月。\n"
"前往克里格斯的神殿朝圣，必得回报。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"This is December, the month of Magic.\n"
"Journey to the Shrine of Blackshire and pray there to be rewarded."
msgstr ""
"现在正是十二月，魔法之月。\n"
"前往布莱克郡的神殿朝圣，必得回报。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"This is February, the month of Intellect.\n"
"Journey to the Shrine of Misty Islands and pray there to be rewarded."
msgstr ""
"现在正是二月，智力之月。\n"
"前往浓雾岛的神殿朝圣，必得回报。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"This is January, the month of Might.\n"
"Journey to the Shrine of Bootleg Bay and pray there to be rewarded."
msgstr ""
"现在正是一月，力量之月。\n"
"前往布特雷格湾的神殿朝圣，必得回报。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"This is July, the month of Luck.\n"
"Journey to the Shrine of New Sorpigal and pray there to be rewarded."
msgstr ""
"现在正是七月，运气之月。\n"
"前往新索匹格的神殿朝圣，必得回报。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"This is June, the month of Speed.\n"
"Journey to the Shrine of Mire of the Damned and pray there to be rewarded."
msgstr ""
"现在正是六月，速度之月。\n"
"前往幽灵沼泽的神殿朝圣，必得回报。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"This is March, the month of Personality.\n"
"Journey to the Shrine of Silver Cove and pray there to be rewarded."
msgstr ""
"现在正是三月，个性之月。\n"
"前往银湾镇的神殿朝圣，必得回报。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"This is May, the month of Accuracy.\n"
"Journey to the Shrine of Free Haven and pray there to be rewarded."
msgstr ""
"现在正是五月，精确之月。\n"
"前往自由天堂的神殿朝圣，必得回报。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"This is November, the month of Earth.\n"
"Journey to the Shrine of Eel Infested Waters and pray there to be rewarded."
msgstr ""
"现在正是十一月，土之月。\n"
"前往魔鬼水域的神殿朝圣，必得回报。"

