msgid ""
"We used to travel freely between the islands using the bridges.\n"
"These bridges were destroyed when the mountain of fire erupted.\n"
"Many families are trapped on the outer islands.\n"
"We don't even know if the people who live there are still alive."
msgstr ""
"我们曾经靠着这些桥梁在各岛屿间自由来往。当火山爆发的时候，这些桥梁都被摧毁了。许多家族都被困在外岛上。我们甚至不知道居住在该地的同胞是否还活着。"

