# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Well met, champions!\n"
"Please, don't waste your valuable time or mine in times like this.\n"
"Use your skills for the good of Enroth and leave me to my planning!\n"
"When this battle is over, THEN we can share tales of valor and skill."
msgstr ""
"勇士们，见到你们真高兴。你我的时间都很宝贵。你们要去拯救整个恩洛斯王国，而我也有自己的事要干。还是等战斗结束了我们再次团聚，再来共叙我们的友谊和交流各自的传奇经历吧！"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Well there, you're looking for a nomination to become cavaliers?\n"
"I was once a valiant knight in my day.\n"
"I fought with Roland in the Succession wars, though now I'm too old to do much good on the battlefield.\n"
"It's good to see Osric keeping the traditions of the knights alive.\n"
"Tell him that I proudly nominate you to become cavaliers, and if he gives you any trouble tell him to come see me himself."
msgstr ""
"你好，听说你在寻找一位举荐人推举你为豪侠？想当年我也曾是一位英勇善战的骑士。尽管现在我已年迈，再也不能冲锋陷阵，驰骋沙场，当年我曾与罗兰德一起参与了继承王位的战争。很高兴看到奥斯利克依然保持着良好的骑士传统。告诉他我很荣幸成为你的举荐。如果他给你什么麻烦的话，让他亲自来见我。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Well, then!\n"
"It is a fine thing to be promoted to crusader, but even finer a thing to be promoted to hero.\n"
"As you may have guessed by now, the condition for hero status is to slay a dragon.\n"
"I know this seems difficult, but tradition has its demands.\n"
"What's worse, you can't slay just any dragon, but must slay a named dragon.\n"
"Your task is to slay Longfang Witherhide and return with a claw or tooth as proof.\n"
"Fortunately, we know that Longfang lives in a cave in the mountains behind Castle Darkmoor.\n"
"He has slain at least twelve would-be heroes, so be careful!"
msgstr ""
"好吧，能成为十字军是件好事。但如能成为英雄就更好了。你也许已经猜到了将去执行什么任务——屠龙。这是难了点，可这是规矩。更难的是你们不能胡乱杀条龙来交差，你们必须杀掉长牙巨龙威瑟海德。它就住在黑摩尔城堡后面山区的山洞里，你必须把它的爪子或是牙齿带回来作为凭证。注意，它已经杀了至少12 个想成为英雄的圣武士，你可得小心点。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Well, this IS a musical instrument, but it's not a harp.\n"
"Let me explain the difference:\n"
"You brought back a flute.\n"
"A flute is a pipe with holes in it.\n"
"A harp has strings.\n"
"Does that help?\n"
"I'm sure they still have the harp and I will reward you well for its return."
msgstr ""
"这是件乐器，但不是竖琴。让我来解释它们的区别：你带回来的是长笛，是有洞的管子，而竖琴有琴弦，懂了吗？我相信竖琴还在，你把它带回来我会报答你的。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Were-rats in Smugglers Cove after Fellmoon's letter has been delivered (Questbit 4).  Rats in Dungeo"
msgstr "走私者聚集处的半鼠人（费尔蒙的信送达后，任务位 4）。地牢中的鼠类"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "Wererat Peasant"
msgstr "鼠人农民"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "Wererats"
msgstr "半鼠人"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"What a gruesome trophy!\n"
"This heart proves you've defeated the wicked spider queen.\n"
"Hopefully now the spiders won't plague New Sorpigal anymore.\n"
"Here is the reward I promised."
msgstr "多么美妙的战利品。这颗蜘蛛的心脏证明你干掉了邪恶的蜘蛛女王。希望蜘蛛不再骚扰新索匹格了。这些是给你的报酬。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"What's this?\n"
"You have the Pearl of Purity?\n"
"I thought Balthasar– oh, he's dead is he?\n"
"I'll keep it for now, then, as per his last wishes.\n"
"Thank you on behalf of both him and me."
msgstr ""
"这是什么？啊，你拿到了纯净珍珠。看到这个令我想起了巴塞萨，哦，他已经与世长辞了。遵从他的遗愿，我将保存这珍珠。我以我们两人共同的名义感谢你。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"When the mage came into town I didn't think much of it.\n"
"This is Ravenshore.\n"
"Everyone who travels the roads of Jadame comes through here at some time or another.\n"
"I guess I should have paid more attention to him.\n"
"Seems he caused quite a stir in the town square."
msgstr ""
"当那个法师来到镇上的时候，我并没有多想。这是渡鸦海滨，任何人在贾丹姆大陆上旅行都几乎会经过的地方。我想我应该更注意他一些的。看起来他似乎在城镇广场上造成了相当的混乱。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Who would have thought that the evil I sought to fight all across Enroth would be found so close to my own home?\n"
"Gerrard Blackames was once my second in command.\n"
"Not long before he murdered me he began corresponding with the Temple of Baa, and they began to feed him targets for our Order.\n"
"I ended up being one of the targets, and Gerrard took control of the Order.\n"
"Now, the Silver Helms are as evil as the people they hunt.\n"
"I'm certain the Temple of Baa is responsible for the corruption of our Order.\n"
"At the same time, Gerrard's brother, Marcus the Sorcerer, has been supplying the Silver Helms with high quality equipment.\n"
"The last I heard, Marcus was assisting someone in a forge on an island to the southeast."
msgstr ""
"谁能料到我驰骋整个恩洛斯征讨的邪恶势力竟在我的眼皮底下。杰拉德·布莱克墨斯曾经是我的二把手。在谋杀我的不久前，他勾结羊鸣教，羊鸣教帮他除去兄弟会里反对他的人，我就是其中一个目标，我死后杰拉德控制了整个银色兄弟会。现在的银舵和他们过去追猎的敌人一样邪恶。我能肯定，我们兄弟会的腐败是羊鸣教导致的。另外，杰拉德的兄弟马库斯，一个巫师，为银舵提供了很多高质量装备，他现在正在东南方一个小岛上的炼铁厂中帮人干活。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "With enemies near: {cost} food"
msgstr "附近有敌人时需要：{cost} 份食物"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"With your skills, you should be working here as a teacher\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"以你的本领，本该在这里当老师\n"
"\n"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "Withdrew {n#} gold."
msgstr "取出 {n#} 金币。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Without the Third Eye, I can't get into the vault to get you the bell that will release Archibald.\n"
"He must have hidden it near the castle, because he used to just go right outside and fetch it whenever he needed to open the vault."
msgstr "没有第三只眼，我无法进入地下室，得到解救阿基巴德的神铃。但我想父亲一定是把它藏在这周围，这样一旦需要，他就可以随时拿出来打开地下室的门。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "Wolves"
msgstr "狼"

