msgid ""
"Wonderful!\n"
"She's not dead after all!\n"
"Thank you for all your trouble.\n"
"I hope you will accept this token of my gratitude."
msgstr "好极了！她还活着。真是麻烦你了。请收下我的一片感激之情。"

