# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"You have brought everything needed to perform the transformation!\n"
"So be it!\n"
"All necromancer's in your party will be transformed into Liches!\n"
"May the dark energies flow through them for all eternity!\n"
"The rest of you will gain what knowledge I can teach them as reward for their assistance!\n"
"Lets begin!After we have completed, good friend Lathean can handle any future promotions for your party."
msgstr ""
"你已经把转换仪式所需要的所有道具都带回来了！那就这样吧！你队伍中所有的死灵法师都会变成巫妖！愿黑暗之力从此永远在他们的体内流动！你们其它人将可以从我这边学到相关的技能，算是我的报答！开始吧！\n"
" 在我们的工作完成之后，我的好友拉席安将会负责诸位未来的晋升。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"You have cleared this dungeon. Resetting it brings every monster back "
msgstr "你已清空这个地城。重置会让所有怪物复活"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"You have cleared this dungeon. Resetting it brings every monster back {n#} levels stronger than at first, with no second completion reward."
msgstr "你已清空这座地下城。重置后所有怪物会回归，并比最初强 {n#} 级，且不再有第二次完成奖励。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"You have done well in finding the Fountain.\n"
"It's location and powers are a secret, do not spread its location around.\n"
"Now, let me show you the secrets of the wizard."
msgstr "你终于找到了喷泉，干得不错。它的地点和用处还是个秘密，千万别透露出去。现在我告诉成为法师的秘密。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"You have found the Axe of Balthazar!\n"
"Have you presented it to Dadeross?\n"
"Without his authentication, we can not proceed with the Rite's of Purity!\n"
"Find him and return to us once you have presented him with the axe!"
msgstr ""
"你找到了巴尔萨煞之斧！你把这个东西拿去给达德洛斯看过了吗？没有他的认证，我们没有办法进行净化之仪式！赶快找到他，将这柄斧头给他认证，并且回到这个地方来。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"You have found the Axe of Balthazar!\n"
"Have you presented it to Dadeross? Ah, you have authentication from Dadeross!\n"
"The Rite's of Purity will begin immediately! You proven yourselves worthy, and our now members of our herd!\n"
"The Minotaurs who travel with you are promoted to Minotaur Lord.\n"
"The others in your group will be taught what skills we have that maybe useful to them."
msgstr ""
"你找到了巴尔萨煞之斧！你拿给达德洛斯看过了吗？啊，你手头有达德洛斯的认证！净化之仪式马上就要开始了！你已经证明了自己的能力，现在也成为了我们之中的一份子。和你们一起旅行的牛头人现在获得了牛头领主的称号。你队伍中的其它人将可以从我这边学到许多有用的技能。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"You have found {a#} of the {b#} trainers on {cont}. The Ledger of Teachers names them all: ask for it in any tavern on {cont2}."
msgstr "你已在{cont}找到 {b#} 位导师中的 {a#} 位。《导师名录》记有全部导师：在{cont2}的任意酒馆都可索取。"

