# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"You think I would promote a Dragon that serves those who have allied themselves with our Mortal enemy, Charles Quixote.\n"
"What arrogance!\n"
"What outrageousness!\n"
"You will have to prove yourselves to me! And in the proving you will deal a serious blow to your allies!\n"
"To the southwest of here, Quixote has established an encampment of his puny \"Dragon Slayers.\"\n"
"This camp is lead by Jeric Whistlebone, the second in command of Quixote's army.\n"
"Destroy this camp!\n"
"Kill all of those who serve Quixote in that region and return to me.\n"
"Return to me with the sword of\n"
"Whistlebone the Slayer."
msgstr ""
"你以为我会将一个和我的死敌查尔斯结盟的龙晋升吗？这实在太无知！太可耻了！你必须要对我证明你自己的能力！但是在证明你自己能力的过程中，你将会对自己的盟友造成极大的伤害！在此地的西南方，吉柯德替他所谓的“屠龙者”创建了一个营地。这个营地是由杰瑞克·惠索朋，吉柯德的副官所带领的。摧毁那座营地！替我杀死该区所有听命于吉柯德的家伙。带着惠索朋家传屠龙神剑回到我身边。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "You wait {a} for the {b} to travel to {c}."
msgstr "你等待了{a}，乘坐{b}前往{c}。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "You wait {w} for the coach. It will take {d} to travel to {dest}."
msgstr "你等了 {w}，马车才到。前往{dest}需要 {d}。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "You wait {w} for the ship. It will take {d} to travel to {dest}."
msgstr "你等了 {w}，船才到。前往{dest}需要 {d}。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"You want to defeat Snergle, do you?\n"
"Well, he knows how he stands among most dwarves.\n"
"He's holed up in Rocklin's old caverns surrounded by a horde of his loyal dwarves.\n"
"If anything were to happen in there, he'd just immediately lock himself in his private room and let his followers handle it.\n"
"You'll need a key to get into his room; there's no way you'll bash down a high quality dwarven door.\n"
"I was a steward for Rocklin– I know that room well and I happen to still have a key to it hidden on me.\n"
"Fortunately for you, I'm in this cell because of Snergle, and there's nothing I'd rather see than his reign put to a quick end.\n"
"Here's the key– think of it as payment for letting me out of this cell."
msgstr ""
"你是不是想打败斯纳格？他知道怎样在众矮人中立于不败之地。他现在深居于洛克林的旧岩洞里，并被忠于他的矮人部落守着。一旦发生意外，他就会立刻锁住寝宫的大门，一切由手下人对付。你必须得到寝宫的钥匙，不然根本打不开那扇牢不可破的石门。我曾是洛克林国王的管家，对那间屋子了如指掌，还藏了把钥匙。你真幸运。我被斯纳格监禁在这儿。我最想看到的是斯纳格的倒台。这是钥匙，是对你救我脱此牢笼的酬劳。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"You want to free Archibald?!\n"
"If the Oracle told you to do it, I guess we should, but he'll be trouble once he's loose, that's for sure.\n"
"I know where the bell is that turned him to stone, but I can't open the family vault that it's in without the Third Eye.\n"
"It's one of three gems you need to put into the door of the vault in order to open it.\n"
"I've got two of them– one in my father's crown and one in his scepter, but my father hid the third one, and he didn't tell me where it is.\n"
"If you could find it, I could open the vault and get the bell."
msgstr ""
"你要搭救阿基巴德？如果是神使指示我们这样做，我们就照办吧。但一旦自由了，他一定会成为我们的麻烦的。我知道把他变成石头的那个神铃藏在哪里。但没有第三只眼我没法打开家里地下室的门。打开门需要三颗宝石，我已经得到了两颗，一颗在我父亲的皇冠上，一颗在他的权杖里。但他没告诉我第三颗，也就是“第三只眼”在哪里。如果你能找到，我就能打开地下室，取出神铃。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"You're not scared of the Warlord, are you?\n"
"His terror needs to be put to an end.\n"
"You can't become champion hiding underneath your bed or standing around looking at the walls– you need to go out and DO it!"
msgstr ""
"你并不害怕军阀，是吗？他的恐怖统治已经到头了。如果你害怕得躲在床底下或只敢在大墙外观望，那你永远不可能成为勇士。你必须勇敢无畏的面对他并与他战斗，快去干吧。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "Your current fine is {gold} gold."
msgstr "当前罚款为 {gold} 金币。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "Your current fine is {n#} gold."
msgstr "你当前的罚金是 {n#} 金币。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "Your last {n#} drops with this filter"
msgstr "你最近 {n#} 次掉落按此筛选的结果"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Your next task is somewhat more difficult…more suited for Spies than Rogues.\n"
"I have been asked to ensure that Watchtower 6, the only tower to survive the recent wars against the Necromancers, be unable to defend itself the next time it is attacked.\n"
"Killing the guards inside won't help—the Necromancers will just fill it again with more troops.\n"
"The tower is on the southern edge of the Necromancers' land.\n"
"I want you to slip inside and move the counterweight in the gatehouse at the top of the tower to the gatehouse at the bottom of the tower.\n"
"It is a heavy weight that can be found in a slot against the wall with a rope tied to it.\n"
"When the time comes for an attack, the misplaced weights will be noticed too late, and the gate will not close.\n"
"If you can do this, you will have proven your status as a Spy."
msgstr ""
"你们的下一个任务可有点难度。看来密探比神偷更适合完成这个任务。现在死灵法师和我们之间的战争已经到了最关键的阶段。我接到命令必须捣毁他们硕果仅存的6 号哨塔，使其丧失战斗力。杀光里面的守兵是无济于事的，死灵法师只会派更多的队伍来防守哨塔。唯一的办法就是派人偷偷潜入那里，把在塔顶哨口里的顶门石移到塔楼底层的房间里去。那块石头就在塔顶一堵墙对面的房间里，用一根绳子系着。你们只要完成任务，我们一旦发动进攻，他们不能关上大门，这样部队就可以长驱直入了。那个哨塔就在死灵法师领地的南部。如果你们能完成这项任务，你们就无愧于密探的称号了。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Your party has already completed this quest. Eligible companions are promoted to"
msgstr "你的队伍已经完成了此任务。符合条件的同伴将被晋升为"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid "Your score: {s}"
msgstr "你的得分：{s}"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Your training does not end with what you have learned as a wizard, one final step remains.\n"
"Master wizard status completes your mastery of elemental magic.\n"
"Building on your wizard training, master wizards have vast magical ability– the most efficient and skilled use of magic anywhere.\n"
"Earning this training requires a powerful artifact, owned by the powerful Arch Mage Drael-.. no, it was Frundir-… no, that's not right either.\n"
"Actually, I can't seem to remember what the artifact was or who owned it.\n"
"I'd remember it if I saw it, though.\n"
"I know it can be found in Corlagon's Estate near the Mire of the Damned.\n"
"Search for it there and return it; I must have it to train you to become a master wizard."
msgstr ""
"你的法术修炼并非到此为止。还有最后一项。只有修炼到魔法大师才能把元素魔法融会贯通。根据你法师修炼的基础，魔法大师将拥有超人一等的法力。他能随时随地纯熟运用各项魔法有效攻击对手。要修炼为大法师必须有一个威力强大的宝物。它在法力无边的大法师德里尔那里。不对，不对。在弗伦德尔那里，不对，也不对。我实在记不起宝物什么样，属于谁了。但我记得我见过它。它在幽灵沼泽附近的考勒根的豪宅里。到那儿看看，把它带回来。有了它，我才能把你训练成魔法大师。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
msgid ""
"Zanthora moved here from the Shadowspire to continue experiments she began at the Necromancers' Guild.\n"
"She desired to create the ultimate horror, the Skeletal Dragon.\n"
"Her fellow Necromancers feared the end result. If the created Dragons where ever to escape Zanthora's control, there would be no stopping them."
msgstr ""
"冉索拉从影旋山脉搬到这里，继续她在死灵法师公会中开始的实验。她想要创造最终极的恐怖怪兽——骷髅飞龙。她的死灵法师同行们都畏惧可能造成的可怕结果。如果那创造出来的骷髅龙逃脱了冉索拉的控制，他们将无法阻止这个怪兽。"

